        "summary": "Distill Skill",
        "description": "Draft a SKILL.md from the memories about a subject.\n\nThe result is a draft for a person to review, never something installed\nautomatically: a skill changes how every agent on the team behaves.",
        "operationId": "distill_skill_v1_skills_distill_post",
